{"id":"int-98b38ad5","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-16T04:12:35.442871Z","actor":"Adam <la-xirsoi> Chevalier","issue_id":"hive-pxy","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Verified end to end on a cold stack: the gateway proxies /api/v1 to the backend (200 with a token, 401 without, never index.html), and a real authorization-code + PKCE login through /idp yields iss=https://localhost:8444/idp/realms/hive, which the backend accepts."}}
